class=\"sv-b\"><span class=\"num\">AEC WORKFORCE TRENDS · NOV 2026</span>\n      <h2 class=\"h3\">How to Build a Dedicated Remote BIM Team</h2>\n      <p>A remote BIM team works when it has a lead, your standards and a rhythm of reporting. How to set one up.</p>\n      <span class=\"sv-go\">1 min read <i>&rarr;</i></span></div>\n    </a>\n        <a class=\"sv rv\" href=\"/insights/ai-automation/ai-in-bim-coordination/\">\n      <div class=\"sv-img\"><img width=\"768\" height=\"512\" src=\"/assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-architect-768x512.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium_large size-medium_large wp-post-image\" alt=\"Architect marking up construction drawings by hand\" loading=\"eager\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"/assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-architect-768x512.jpg 768w, /assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-architect-300x200.jpg 300w, /assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-architect-1024x683.jpg 1024w, /assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-architect-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, /assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-architect.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\" /></div>\n      <div class=\"sv-b\"><span class=\"num\">AI &amp; AUTOMATION · NOV 2026</span>\n      <h2 class=\"h3\">AI in BIM Modeling and Coordination</h2>\n      <p>AI is starting to appear in BIM tools. What it can usefully do now, what still needs an engineer, and how to…</p>\n      <span class=\"sv-go\">1 min read <i>&rarr;</i></span></div>\n    </a>\n        <a class=\"sv rv\" href=\"/insights/bim-standards/bim-execution-plan-guide/\">\n      <div class=\"sv-img\"><img width=\"768\" height=\"512\" src=\"/assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-plan-desk-768x512.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium_large size-medium_large wp-post-image\" alt=\"Architectural drawing on a desk with a pen\" loading=\"eager\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"/assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-plan-desk-768x512.jpg 768w, /assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-plan-desk-300x200.jpg 300w, /assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-plan-desk-1024x683.jpg 1024w, /assets/u