-s-coord-768x512.jpg 768w, /assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-s-coord-300x200.jpg 300w, /assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-s-coord-1024x683.jpg 1024w, /assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-s-coord-1536x1025.jpg 1536w, /assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-s-coord.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\" /></div>\n      <div class=\"sv-b\"><span class=\"num\">TECHNICAL GUIDES · NOV 2026</span>\n      <h2 class=\"h3\">How to Reduce BIM Coordination Rework</h2>\n      <p>Most coordination rework comes from process, not software. Ten practical changes that reduce it.</p>\n      <span class=\"sv-go\">1 min read <i>&rarr;</i></span></div>\n    </a>\n        <a class=\"sv rv\" href=\"/insights/bim-staffing/bim-outsourcing-saudi-arabia/\">\n      <div class=\"sv-img\"><img width=\"768\" height=\"432\" src=\"/assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-c-found-768x432.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium_large size-medium_large wp-post-image\" alt=\"Aerial view of foundations and a steel frame on a construction site\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"/assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-c-found-768x432.jpg 768w, /assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-c-found-300x169.jpg 300w, /assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-c-found-1024x576.jpg 1024w, /assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-c-found-1536x864.jpg 1536w, /assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-c-found.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\" /></div>\n      <div class=\"sv-b\"><span class=\"num\">BIM STAFFING INSIGHTS · OCT 2026</span>\n      <h2 class=\"h3\">BIM Outsourcing for Saudi Arabia Projects</h2>\n      <p>Saudi programmes are creating demand for BIM capacity faster than local hiring can follow. How remote and regional BIM support can fit…</p>\n      <span class=\"sv-go\">1 min read <i>&rarr;</i></span></div>\n    </a>\n        <a class=\"sv rv\" href=\"/insights/bim-technology/revit-skills-bim-architect/\">\n      <div class=\"sv-img\"><img width=\"768\" height=\"512\" src=\"/assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-s-arch-768x512.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium_large size-medium_large wp-post-image\" alt=\"Curved glass curtain wall facade\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"/assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-s-arch-768x512.jpg 768w, /assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-s-arch-300x200.jpg 300w, /assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-s-arch-1024x683.jpg 1024w, /assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-s-arch-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, /assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-s-arch.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\" /></div>\n      <div class=\"sv-b\"><span class=\"num\">BIM TECHNOLOGY · OCT 2026</span>\n      <h2 class=\"h3\">Revit Skills Every BIM Architect Should Know</h2>\n      <p>Modelling walls is the easy part. These are the Revit skills that make a BIM architect productive on a real multi-discipline project.</p>\n      <span class=\"sv-go\">1 min read <i>&rarr;</i></span></div>\n    </a>\n        <a class=\"sv rv\" href=\"/insights/bim-staffing/choose-bim-staffing-company/\">\n      <div class=\"sv-img\"><img width=\"768\" height=\"512\" src=\"/assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-plan-desk-768x512.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium_large size-medium_large wp-post-image\" alt=\"Architectural drawing on a desk with a pen\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"/assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-plan-desk-768x512.jpg 768w, /assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-plan-desk-300x200.jpg 300w, /assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-plan-desk-1024x683.jpg 1024w, /assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-plan-desk-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, /assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-plan-desk.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\" /></div>\n      <div class=\"sv-b\"><span class=\"num\">BIM STAFFING INSIGHTS · OCT 2026</span>\n      <h2 class=\"h3\">How to Choose a BIM Staffing Company</h2>\n      <p>Any agency can send CVs. A BIM staffing partner should show how candidates were assessed and what happens when a placement does…</p>\n      <span class=\"sv-go\">1 min read <i>&rarr;</i></span></div>\n    </a>\n        <a class=\"sv rv\" href=\"/insights/aec-workforce/bim-coordinator-vs-bim-manager/\">\n      <div class=\"sv-img\"><img width=\"768\" height=\"512\" src=\"/assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-review-768x512.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium_large size-medium_large wp-post-image\" alt=\"Two engineers reviewing a 3D model on a laptop\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"/assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-review-768x512.jpg 768w, /assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-review-300x200.jpg 300w, /assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-review-1024x683.jpg 1024w, /assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-review-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, /assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-review.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\" /></div>\n      <div class=\"sv-b\"><span class=\"num\">AEC WORKFORCE TRENDS · OCT 2026</span>\n      <h2 class=\"h3\">BIM Coordinator vs BIM Manager</h2>\n      <p>Coordinators run the model process day to day; managers own the information strategy. Hiring the wrong one leaves a gap either way.</p>\n      <span class=\"sv-go\">1 min read <i>&rarr;</i></span></div>\n    </a>\n        <a class=\"sv rv\" href=\"/insights/technical-guides/bim-engineer-technical-assessment/\">\n      <div class=\"sv-img\"><img width=\"768\" height=\"512\" src=\"/assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-architect-768x512.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium_large size-medium_large wp-post-image\" alt=\"Architect marking up construction drawings by hand\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"/assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-architect-768x512.jpg 768w, /assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-architect-300x200.jpg 300w, /assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-architect-1024x683.jpg 1024w, /assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-architect-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, /assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-architect.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\" /></div>\n      <div class=\"sv-b\"><span class=\"num\">TECHNICAL GUIDES · OCT 2026</span>\n      <h2 class=\"h3\">How to Evaluate a BIM Engineer&#8217;s Technical Skills</h2>\n      <p>CVs and interviews overstate BIM skills. A structured evaluation with a practical task shows what a BIM engineer can actually produce.</p>\n      <span class=\"sv-go\">1 min read <i>&rarr;</i></span></div>\n    </a>\n        <a class=\"sv rv\" href=\"/insights/bim-staffing/onsite-vs-remote-bim-staffing/\">\n      <div class=\"sv-img\"><img width=\"768\" height=\"512\" src=\"/assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-onsite-768x512.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium_large size-medium_large wp-post-image\" alt=\"Engineer in a hard hat reviewing a model on a tablet on site\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"/assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-onsite-768x512.jpg 768w, /assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-onsite-300x200.jpg 300w, /assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-onsite-1024x683.jpg 1024w, /assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-onsite-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, /assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-onsite.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 768px) 100vw, 768px\" /></div>\n      <div class=\"sv-b\"><span class=\"num\">BIM STAFFING INSIGHTS · OCT 2026</span>\n      <h2 class=\"h3\">Onsite vs Remote BIM Staffing</h2>\n      <p>Onsite BIM staff are close to decisions; remote staff add capacity without desks or relocation. Most projects need some of each.</p>\n      <span class=\"sv-go\">1 min read <i>&rarr;</i></span></div>\n    </a>\n        <a class=\"sv rv\" href=\"/insights/bim-staffing/hire-bim-engineers-dubai/\">\n      <div class=\"sv-img\"><img width=\"768\" height=\"512\" src=\"/assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-dxb-sil-768x512.jpg\" class=\"attachment-medium_large size-medium_large wp-post-image\" alt=\"Silhouette of the Dubai skyline at sunset\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"/assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-dxb-sil-768x512.jpg 768w, /assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-dxb-sil-300x200.jpg 300w, /assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-dxb-sil-1024x683.jpg 1024w, /assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-dxb-sil-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, /assets/uploads/2026/11/engisoft-dxb